    <heading level="1">Practice Makes Perfect</heading>
    <paragraph>Find the Domain and Range of a Relation</paragraph>
    <paragraph>In the following exercises, for each relation ⓐ find the domain of the relation ⓑ find the range of the relation.</paragraph>
    <exercise number="283" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\left. \left\{ {\left( {1,4} \right),\left( {2,8} \right),\left( {3,12} \right),\left( {4,16} \right),} \right.\left( {5,20} \right) \right\}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>ⓐ {1, 2, 3, 4, 5} ⓑ {4, 8, 12, 16, 20}</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="284" has_solution="false">
