        <paragraph>$$f(x) = 2x^{2} - x + 3$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>ⓐ $$f(2)=9f(2)=9$$ ⓑ $$f(-1)=6f(-1)=6$$ ⓒ $$f(a)=2a2-a+3f(a)=2a2-a+3$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
